msgstr "프롬프트를 보내는 사용자의 프로필 정보."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/agents-context-management.rst:20
msgid "Chat messages exchanged between the user and the bot."
msgstr "사용자와 봇 간에 교환된 채팅 메시지."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/agents-context-management.rst:22
msgid "**Additional context in direct messages**"
msgstr "**개인 메시지의 추가 컨텍스트**"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/agents-context-management.rst:24
